{"slug": "25m-sanlorenzo-motor-yacht-jerico-sold", "title": "25m Sanlorenzo Motor Yacht Jerico Sold", "description": "Denison Yachting has announced the sale of the 24.6-metre motor yacht Jerico, with Denison’s Sidney Ambroise representing the buyer and Arney Mendez of Florida Yachts International (FYI Yachts) representing the seller in the deal.", "date": "2022-09-14", "category": "Sold Yachts", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/46-1-1.png", "html": "<p>Written by Georgia Tindale<br/>30 July 2020 | 04:00 ()</p><p><a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/denison-yachting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Denison Yachting</a> has announced the sale of the 24.6-metre motor yacht <em><a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/jerico\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jerico</a>, </em>with Denison’s Sidney Ambroise representing the buyer and Arney Mendez of <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/florida-yachts-international-fyi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Florida Yachts International (FYI Yachts)</a> representing the seller in the deal.</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/46-1.png\" alt=\"New owners for 46m superyacht Excellence\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>Built in 2010, <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a>, ex. <em>Status Quo</em>, features exterior design by <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/setzer-yacht-architects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setzer</a>, while her interior was penned by <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/pavlik-design-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pavlik Design Team</a>. <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a> can accommodate as many as 10 guests between five guest cabins.</p><p>Her interior is complete in mahogany with a satin finish, and her stateroom layout includes a full-beam master suite on the main deck, and four additional staterooms on the lower deck, all with en suite bathrooms.</p><p>Externally, she features al fresco lounge and dining options on each of her three decks, a Jacuzzi for eight guests and a touch-and-go helipad.</p><p>The motor yacht <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a>, sold, is powered by twin 2,000hp <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/mtu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MTU</a> diesel engines and cruises at 16 knots and reaches a top speed of 18 knots, and her guests are taken care of by a crew of 9. She had a last known asking price of $16,995,000.</p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198943-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198943-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198941-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198941-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198944-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198944-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198901-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198901-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198897-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198897-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198895-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198895-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198949-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198949-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198947-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198947-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198925-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198925-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a>"}